      "text": "the row is left, and its home\nhas no thread: it is yours\n[when a Result paused on other\nrows or a Result that leaves\nsomething or its turn\ncompleted, no Result or its\nturn completed, no Result, 1\nof 2 carry-ons sent or its\nturn completed, no Result, 2\nof 2 carry-ons sent or its\nturn is hung, no Result or its\nturn is hung, no Result, 1 of\n2 carry-ons sent or its turn\nis hung, no Result, 2 of 2\ncarry-ons sent or its turn was\nrolled back, no Result or its\nturn was rolled back, no\nResult, 1 of 2 carry-ons sent\nor its turn was rolled back,\nno Result, 2 of 2 carry-ons\nsent]",
